<title>JAPAN: JSDA reports July foreign investment in Japan mkt.</title>
<headline>JSDA reports July foreign investment in Japan mkt.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment by non-residents in Japanese capital markets for July were as follows, the Japan Securities Dealers Association (JSDA) said on Tuesday (in billions of yen):</p>
<p>	   INVESTMENT IN YEN BONDS</p>
<p>	  US/Canada  Europe     Asia   Others   Total</p>
<p> July     +202.0  +1,078.1   +452.4   +183.5 +1,915.9</p>
<p> June     +349.2  +1,355.8   +304.5   +218.5 +2,228.0</p>
<p>	   INVESTMENT IN JAPANESE STOCKS</p>
<p> July	-62.0     -84.7    +15.1    -18.3   -149.9</p>
<p> June     +220.8    +228.1    +98.7     +5.5   +533.0</p>
</text>
